s concubine. Shirayuki refuses, chops off her lovely locks, and runs away to the neighboring kingdom of Clarines. There, she befriends a young man named Zen, who, SURPRISE, is also a prince, although with a much better temperament than the previous one. Watch as Shirayuki finds her place in the new kingdom, and in Zen’s heart.\n\n(Source: FUNimation)"},"tags":[{"name":"Shoujo","rank":97,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Medicine","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Medieval","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Work","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":62,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Politics","rank":57,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Agriculture","rank":51,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":48,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":37,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":25,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Conspiracy","rank":20,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Snow White with the Red Hair","english":"Snow White with the Red Hair","native":"赤髪の白雪姫","romaji":"Akagami no Shirayuki-hime","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"赤发白雪姬"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Akagami no Shirayuki hime"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"赤髮白雪姬"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"红发的白雪公主"}]},"trailer":{"id":"XzXLibJm6GE","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/XzXLibJm6GE/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}